<title>USA: Praxair unit buys Spanish metal coating co.</title>
<headline>Praxair unit buys Spanish metal coating co.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Praxair Inc said Monday its Praxair Surface Technologies subsidiary bought privately-held Metalcoat of Spain.</p>
<p>Metal coating company Metalcoat, based near Barcelona, has about $1 million in annual sales, Praxair said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Metalcoat acquisition represents a strategic expansion of Praxair's surface enhancement technologies and capabilities into the Spanish market as well markets in Portugal and southern France,&quot; said Praxair Surface Technologies president Thomas von Krannichfeldt in a statement.</p>
</text>
